  "html": "<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"-검색-retrieval\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#-검색-retrieval\" class=\"peer\">② 검색 (Retrieval)</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p><code>POST /rag/{spaceId}/retrieve</code> — 검색어로 관련 청크를 가져옵니다.</p>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>옵션</th><th>설명</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>mode</strong></td><td>벡터(의미 기반) · 키워드(정확 매칭) · 하이브리드(벡터+키워드)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>top_k</strong></td><td>가져올 청크 수 (1~100)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>hybrid_weight</strong></td><td>하이브리드일 때 벡터·키워드 가중치</td></tr><tr><td><strong>use_reranker</strong></td><td>리랭커로 재정렬 사용 여부</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><strong>use_reranker</strong>를 켜면 <strong>reranker_model</strong>에 사용할 리랭커 모델 ID를 함께 입력합니다.</p>\n<p>예시 코드 주석에는 메타데이터 필터(<code>filters</code>)와 RRF 융합(<code>rrf_rank_constant</code>) 같은 추가 인자도 안내됩니다.</p>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>선택한 버전에 sparse 임베딩이 없으면 키워드·하이브리드 모드가 비활성화되고, <strong>조회만/파싱만</strong> 버전은 검색을 사용할 수 없습니다(청크 조회를 사용하세요).</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<p>RAGOps에서 만든 RAG는 검색 <strong>API</strong>로 노출됩니다. 이 API를 워크플로우의 <strong>API 블록</strong>에 연결하고\n<strong>Agent 블록</strong>에 물려주면, 우리 데이터를 근거로 답하는 RAG 챗봇(AI Agent)을 만들 수 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>이 문서는 <a href=\"#/detail/ragops/rag-space/api\">API 키 발급하기</a> 안내에 따라 API 키 발급을\n마쳤다는 전제로 진행합니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"전체-흐름\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#전체-흐름\" class=\"peer\">전체 흐름</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>가장 단순한 RAG 챗봇은 세 블록이면 됩니다.</p>\n<figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Start  →  API (검색 호출)  →  Agent (검색결과로 답변)</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>블록</th><th>역할</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Start</strong></td><td>사용자 질문을 입력받는 시작점</td></tr><tr><td><strong>API</strong></td><td>RAG Space의 <strong>검색 API</strong>를 호출해 관련 청크를 가져옴</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Agent</strong></td><td>가져온 청크를 근거(context)로 사용자 질문에 답변</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>청크를 조건 없이 &quot;그대로 조회&quot;만 할 땐 청크 조회 API, &quot;질문으로 검색&quot;할 땐 검색(retrieve) API를 씁니다.\n챗봇에는 보통 <strong>검색 API</strong>를 사용합니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<p>블록을 캔버스에 추가하고 연결하는 기본 조작은 <a href=\"#/detail/workflow/builder\">워크플로우 편집기</a>를 참고하세요.</p>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"1-사전-준비--검색-api와-api-키\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#1-사전-준비--검색-api와-api-키\" class=\"peer\">1. 사전 준비 — 검색 API와 API 키</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<div class=\"fd-steps\"><div class=\"fd-step\"><p>RAG Space의 <strong>API 탭</strong>에서 호출할 <strong>인덱스 버전</strong>을 고르고, 배지가 <strong>검색가능</strong>인지 확인합니다.\n(조회만/파싱만 버전은 검색이 안 됩니다 → <a href=\"#/detail/ragops/rag-space/api#%EB%B2%84%EC%A0%84-%EC%84%A0%ED%83%9D\">인덱스 버전 선택하기</a> 참고)</p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p>같은 화면에서 <strong>API 키를 발급</strong>해 복사해 둡니다. 키는 발급 시 <strong>한 번만</strong> 표시됩니다. 요청 헤더 <code>X-API-Key</code>에 사용합니다.</p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p>API 탭이 보여주는 <strong>cURL 예시</strong>를 복사해 둡니다. 아래에서 이 값을 워크플로우 API 블록에 그대로 옮깁니다.</p></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"2-api-블록-설정--curl을-블록-필드로-옮기기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#2-api-블록-설정--curl을-블록-필드로-옮기기\" class=\"peer\">2. API 블록 설정 — cURL을 블록 필드로 옮기기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>RAG Space가 보여주는 검색 cURL 예시(형태):</p>\n<figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -X</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> POST</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &quot;https://&lt;RAG 호스트&gt;/api/v2/rag/&lt;spaceId&gt;/retrieve&quot;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -H</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &quot;X-API-Key: hn_live_...&quot;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -H</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x27;{ &quot;query&quot;: &quot;...&quot;, &quot;top_k&quot;: 5, &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;vector&quot; }&#x27;</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>\n<p>이걸 워크플로우 <strong>API 블록</strong>에 아래처럼 매핑합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>cURL 요소</th><th>API 블록 입력</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>POST</code></td><td><strong>Method</strong> = <code>POST</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>.../retrieve</code> URL</td><td><strong>URL</strong> 입력창</td></tr><tr><td><code>-H &quot;X-API-Key: ...&quot;</code></td><td><strong>Headers</strong> → Key <code>X-API-Key</code> / Value = 발급받은 키</td></tr><tr><td><code>-H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot;</code></td><td><strong>Headers</strong> → <code>Content-Type</code> = <code>application/json</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>-d &#x27;{...}&#x27;</code></td><td><strong>Body</strong>(JSON) 입력창</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-warning, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p><code>X-API-Key</code> 헤더가 빠지거나 값이 틀리면 <strong>401</strong>이 납니다. 헤더 이름과 키 값을 먼저 확인하세요.</p></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>Body에서 자주 쓰는 값</strong> (RAG Space API 탭 기준):</p>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>필드</th><th>설명</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>query</code></td><td>검색할 질문. 워크플로우에선 Start 입력(<code>&lt;start.input&gt;</code>)을 연결 (아래)</td></tr><tr><td><code>mode</code></td><td><code>vector</code>(의미) · <code>keyword</code>(정확) · <code>hybrid</code>(둘 다)</td></tr><tr><td><code>top_k</code></td><td>가져올 청크 수</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>워크플로우 API 블록에서는 <code>query</code> 값에 리터럴 대신 <strong><code>&lt;start.input&gt;</code></strong>(사용자 질문)을 넣습니다.\n예: Body를 <code>{ &quot;query&quot;: &quot;&lt;start.input&gt;&quot;, &quot;top_k&quot;: 5, &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;vector&quot; }</code> 로 작성하면 사용자가 입력한 질문으로 검색합니다.</p><p>참고: <code>&lt;start.input&gt;</code>은 Start 블록의 <strong>기본 입력 필드</strong>입니다. Start에 입력 필드를 따로 정의했다면 <code>&lt;start.필드명&gt;</code> 형태로 참조하세요.</p></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>API 블록의 출력은 <code>data</code>(응답 본문) · <code>status</code> · <code>headers</code> 세 가지입니다.\n검색 결과는 <code>data</code> 안에 들어옵니다(경로는 3단계에서 참조).</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"3-응답을-변수로-참조--블록-출력-변수-규칙\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#3-응답을-변수로-참조--블록-출력-변수-규칙\" class=\"peer\">3. 응답을 변수로 참조 — 블록 출력 변수 규칙</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>블록의 출력은 <strong><code>&lt;블록이름.경로&gt;</code></strong> 형식으로 참조합니다. 참조 키는 블록의 <strong>이름</strong>이며,\n<strong>공백·<code>_</code>·<code>-</code>·대소문자는 무시</strong>됩니다. (예: &quot;API 1&quot; 블록 → <code>api1</code>)</p>\n<p>예를 들어 API 블록 이름이 <code>API 1</code>이고, 검색 응답 <code>data</code>가 아래와 같다면:</p>\n<figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">&quot;results&quot;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [ { </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">&quot;content&quot;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&quot;...&quot;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } ] }</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>\n<p>검색 결과 목록은 이렇게 참조합니다.</p>\n<figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&lt;api1.data.results&gt;</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-warning, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>코파일럿이 <code>&lt;knowledge.results&gt;</code> 같은 형태를 제안할 수 있지만, 실제로는\n<strong>블록 이름 + 응답 경로</strong>를 정확히 조합해야 동작합니다.\n응답 경로(<code>data.results</code> 등)는 API 블록의 <strong>실제 응답 결과를 보고</strong> 맞추세요.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"4-agent-블록에-검색-결과-연결\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#4-agent-블록에-검색-결과-연결\" class=\"peer\">4. Agent 블록에 검색 결과 연결</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<div class=\"fd-steps\"><div class=\"fd-step\"><p>Agent 블록을 API 블록 다음에 연결합니다.</p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p>Agent의 **messages(프롬프트)**에서 검색 결과를 근거로 넣습니다.</p><figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>아래 검색 결과를 근거로 사용자 질문에 답하세요.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[검색 결과]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&lt;api1.data.results&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[질문]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&lt;start.input&gt;</span></span></code></pre></div></figure></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p>&quot;근거에 없으면 모른다고 답하라&quot; 같은 지침을 추가해 환각을 줄입니다.</p></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"5-실행-및-검증\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#5-실행-및-검증\" class=\"peer\">5. 실행 및 검증</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<div class=\"fd-steps\"><div class=\"fd-step\">편집기에서 워크플로우를 실행하고, 질문을 입력합니다.</div><div class=\"fd-step\">API 블록이 검색 결과를 받아오는지, Agent가 그 결과를 근거로 답하는지 확인합니다.</div><div class=\"fd-step\">401이면 <code>X-API-Key</code> 헤더를, 빈 결과면 인덱스 버전(검색가능)·<code>query</code> 연결을 점검합니다.</div></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>블록을 어떻게 구성할지 막막하면, 위 <strong>Start → API(검색) → Agent</strong> 최소 구성을 기준으로 시작하세요.\n코파일럿 자동 생성 결과도 이 구조를 이해한 상태에서 검토하면 훨씬 수월합니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>완성한 워크플로우를 챗봇 인터페이스 등으로 배포하려면 <a href=\"#/detail/workflow/deploy-status\">배포 현황</a>을 참고하세요.</p></div></div></div>"
}